<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005"><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post7282887357428952712..comments</id><updated>2017-04-13T04:47:21.148-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Comments on Pro Libertate: My President Is Nobody</title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/feeds/comments/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7282887357428952712/comments/default'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/01/my-president-is-nobody.html'/><link rel="hub" href="http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>9</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1968066520638770823</id><published>2008-01-29T13:52:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-01-29T13:52:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Al;Well played sir!</title><content type='html'>Al;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Well played sir!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7282887357428952712/comments/default/1968066520638770823'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7282887357428952712/comments/default/1968066520638770823'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/01/my-president-is-nobody.html?showComment=1201639920000#c1968066520638770823' title=''/><author><name>negatore</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/01/my-president-is-nobody.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7282887357428952712' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7282887357428952712' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 29, 2008 at 1:52 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1269006021948815748</id><published>2008-01-29T12:52:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-01-29T12:52:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>&quot;Anybody seeking the [presidency] (unless he empha...</title><content type='html'>&quot;Anybody seeking the [presidency] (unless he emphatically and credibly seeks to reduce it to something like its constitutionally appropriate size) should be considered unworthy of holding any office of public trust.&quot;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;This is the key point. With the constitutional balance of powers having broken down, the presidency has acquired the discretionary capriciousness of an imperial emperorship. Any candidate whose announced objectives do not include stripping the office of its accretions of unaccountable power is, by definition, a dangerous megalomaniac.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Every candidate but one is ambitious to exercise those hypertrophied powers. None of these, regardless of party or platform, should be considered qualified to serve. The powers of a dictator are patently incompatible with democracy.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7282887357428952712/comments/default/1269006021948815748'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7282887357428952712/comments/default/1269006021948815748'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/01/my-president-is-nobody.html?showComment=1201636320000#c1269006021948815748' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/01/my-president-is-nobody.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7282887357428952712' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7282887357428952712' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 29, 2008 at 12:52 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5694653789466155138</id><published>2008-01-29T10:52:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-01-29T10:52:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>negatore,I see only one flaw in your logic, and th...</title><content type='html'>negatore,&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;I see only one flaw in your logic, and that is the flaw of assuming a President has a soul to sell.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7282887357428952712/comments/default/5694653789466155138'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7282887357428952712/comments/default/5694653789466155138'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/01/my-president-is-nobody.html?showComment=1201629120000#c5694653789466155138' title=''/><author><name>Al Newberry</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/12702350396853727859</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='22' height='32' src='http://bp3.blogger.com/_PpN1JG1keYU/R4LeYbKSzzI/AAAAAAAAAAM/kR7nNzAi74g/S220/aleguit1.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/01/my-president-is-nobody.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7282887357428952712' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7282887357428952712' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-2027341530"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 29, 2008 at 10:52 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2713973932245955468</id><published>2008-01-29T07:17:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-01-29T07:17:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Somebody put some ornery in your Cheerios this mor...</title><content type='html'>Somebody put some ornery in your Cheerios this morning. Great article.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7282887357428952712/comments/default/2713973932245955468'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7282887357428952712/comments/default/2713973932245955468'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/01/my-president-is-nobody.html?showComment=1201616220000#c2713973932245955468' title=''/><author><name>joconnor3</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/00793685202034508386</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/01/my-president-is-nobody.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7282887357428952712' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7282887357428952712' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-964193711"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 29, 2008 at 7:17 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4423105256379990079</id><published>2008-01-28T21:44:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-01-28T21:44:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Hey Will! If Nobody is your President, I&#39;d like to...</title><content type='html'>Hey Will! If Nobody is your President, I&#39;d like to be your Congressman:&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;A HREF=&quot;http://nobodyforcongress.com&quot; REL=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://NobodyForCongress.com&lt;/A&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7282887357428952712/comments/default/4423105256379990079'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7282887357428952712/comments/default/4423105256379990079'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/01/my-president-is-nobody.html?showComment=1201581840000#c4423105256379990079' title=''/><author><name>Kevin Craig</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/16928605106263140137</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='22' height='32' src='http://www.geocities.com/jakeporter_88/KC1983.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/01/my-president-is-nobody.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7282887357428952712' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7282887357428952712' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-895897812"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 28, 2008 at 9:44 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4811517579566926892</id><published>2008-01-28T19:11:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-01-28T19:11:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Shame on you Mr. Grigg!Where&#39;s your sense of decen...</title><content type='html'>Shame on you Mr. Grigg!&lt;BR/&gt;Where&#39;s your sense of decency?&lt;BR/&gt;With all due respect to the Office of the Presidency, I&#39;d like to offer my own evaluation in the subtle vernacular of the American bumper sticker ethos:&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&quot;Somewhere, someone&#39;s president is George W., aka President Simian, son of excrement, glorious leader of the uninformed idolatrous wicker people and Commander-in-Chief of the Empire of Sh*t!&quot;&lt;BR/&gt;(Sound of escaping flatulence reverberating in the background, serving as an aromatic incense filling the hallowed air with an aura of awe; please pause for genuflection and meditation or whatever)</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7282887357428952712/comments/default/4811517579566926892'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7282887357428952712/comments/default/4811517579566926892'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/01/my-president-is-nobody.html?showComment=1201572660000#c4811517579566926892' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/01/my-president-is-nobody.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7282887357428952712' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7282887357428952712' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 28, 2008 at 7:11 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3982507408766727713</id><published>2008-01-28T15:52:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-01-28T15:52:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>&quot;And a presidential candidate is in the business o...</title><content type='html'>&lt;I&gt;&quot;And a presidential candidate is in the business of buying the votes of some by promising to make war on the rights of others.&quot;&lt;/I&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;When the President buys the votes of some by promising to make war on the rights of others he is selling his soul.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7282887357428952712/comments/default/3982507408766727713'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7282887357428952712/comments/default/3982507408766727713'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/01/my-president-is-nobody.html?showComment=1201560720000#c3982507408766727713' title=''/><author><name>negatore</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/01/my-president-is-nobody.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7282887357428952712' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7282887357428952712' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 28, 2008 at 3:52 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3859687583668200654</id><published>2008-01-28T14:51:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-01-28T14:51:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>The picture of the ghosts of Washington and Lincol...</title><content type='html'>The picture of the ghosts of Washington and Lincoln laying hands on Bush was shown in a slideshow at my church as part of a &quot;patriotic&quot; tribute to our troops on Veterans&#39; Day 2006.  After a year of holding my tongue and being polite while listening to my pastor spout nonsense about Bush being &quot;annointed by God&quot;, I got up out of that pew, headed straight for the door and never looked back.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7282887357428952712/comments/default/3859687583668200654'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7282887357428952712/comments/default/3859687583668200654'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/01/my-president-is-nobody.html?showComment=1201557060000#c3859687583668200654' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/01/my-president-is-nobody.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7282887357428952712' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7282887357428952712' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 28, 2008 at 2:51 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1416573058627147046</id><published>2008-01-28T11:20:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-01-28T11:20:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>My president is Christ.</title><content type='html'>My president is Christ.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7282887357428952712/comments/default/1416573058627147046'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7282887357428952712/comments/default/1416573058627147046'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/01/my-president-is-nobody.html?showComment=1201544400000#c1416573058627147046' title=''/><author><name>Al Newberry</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/12702350396853727859</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='22' height='32' src='http://bp3.blogger.com/_PpN1JG1keYU/R4LeYbKSzzI/AAAAAAAAAAM/kR7nNzAi74g/S220/aleguit1.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/01/my-president-is-nobody.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7282887357428952712' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7282887357428952712' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-2027341530"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 28, 2008 at 11:20 AM"/></entry></feed>